("v341", "scalar", "A miniature running in your browser — an illustration of Temple3’s kernel, not Temple3 itself. It uses real SHA-256 over canonical bytes, a simplified Merkle commitment, its own error codes, and a covenant written in the kernel’s operator vocabulary: literal, read, eq, not, all, any.")
